It is derived from two datasets, both licensed under CC BY 4.0. If you use this data, please also credit them:

* 20-MAD: Maëlick Claes and Mika V. Mäntylä. "20-MAD: 20 Years of Issues and Commits of Mozilla and Apache
  Development." Proceedings of the 17th International Conference on Mining Software Repositories (MSR 2020).
  Data: https://github.com/M3SOulu/MozillaApacheDataset-sample
* SmartSHARK: Alexander Trautsch, Fabian Trautsch, Steffen Herbold. "The SmartSHARK Repository Mining Data."
  Release 2.1 Small, GRO.data, doi:10.25625/PHV2VX

Changes made: record structure (ids, hashes, timestamps, links between records) is kept from the source datasets.
Every name, email address, username and personal reference was replaced by a synthetic identity. Free text from
20-MAD was sanitized; free text in the SmartSHARK-derived tasks is generated from templates. See docs/DATA.md.

